## Open Threads

- TVL value $12.4M from DeFiLlama (2024-11) needs verification against on-chain staking program data — TVL definition for Render Network unclear (staked tokens? escrowed job fees? both?)
- Daily Active Users metric not published by any official source — third-party estimates (Token Terminal, Messari) may exist but not verified
